<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Exposes highp_bvec1, mediump_bvec1 and lowp_bvec1 types.</para>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_vector__bool1__precision_8hpp">glm/ext/vector_bool1_precision.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>
</section>
